{'symbol': 'CBRE', 'date': '2023-02-10 08:30:00', 'title': 'ALTUS POWER INTRODUCES COMMUNITY SOLAR PARTNERSHIP PROGRAM TO CBRE AND BLACKSTONE EMPLOYEES ACROSS THE NORTHEAST', 'text': "STAMFORD, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ALTUS POWER, INC. (“ALTUS POWER”) (NYSE: AMPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED, IN PARTNERSHIP WITH BLACKSTONE (NYSE: BX) AND CBRE (NYSE: CBRE), ALTUS POWER HAS ADVANCED ITS COMMUNITY SOLAR PARTNERSHIP PROGRAM FOR LARGE ENTERPRISES BY OFFERING EACH COMPANY'S EMPLOYEES THE OPPORTUNITY TO SUBSCRIBE TO THE BENEFITS OF CLEAN ELECTRICITY FROM SOLAR ARRAYS OWNED AND OPERATED BY ALTUS POWER."}